6.2062500000000131 Tw
0. -9.7749999999999986 Td
(and products based on this interactive technology were introduced to the world. The AI Smart Mirror is a project that combines) Tj
7.5350000000000188 Tw
0. -9.7749999999999986 Td
(the functionality of a traditional mirror with the intelligence of artificial intelligence. The project uses a Raspberry Pi 3B+, a) Tj
8.5344444444444623 Tw
0. -9.7749999999999986 Td
(two-way mirror, a display, a camera, and various sensors to create a smart mirror that can display information, provide) Tj
7.3806250000000269 Tw
0. -9.7749999999999986 Td
(assistance, and improve everyday routines. The mirror can display the time, weather, news, and other personalized information.) Tj
6.7966666666666873 Tw
0. -9.7749999999999986 Td
(It can also provide assistance through voice commands, facial recognition, and gesture recognition. The project can be used in) Tj
7.7175000000000225 Tw
0. -9.7749999999999986 Td
(homes, offices, and public spaces. Users can interact with the mirror by issuing commands, allowing for a more interactive) Tj
0 Tw
0. -9.7749999999999986 Td
(experience.) Tj
